hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3001","Narrated to us 'Ali ibn Khashram, who said: 'Isa informed us, on the authority of 'Ubaydullah, from Nafi', from Ibn 'Umar (RA), who said:\n\The one who performs Hajj should make his final act at the House (i.e."","" the Ka'bah)"","" except for those who are menstruating. For indeed"","" the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) granted them a concession.\""\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
